            </profile>
            <profile id="75d4-bd88-2fef-17c3" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Has a hand weapon, light armour, thrusting spear and shield. Stubborn. Shieldwall. Riding Horses. May have heavy armour (+1), javelins (+1), and may exchange thrusting spear for two-handed axe (+1). Varangians advanced aggressively and their shieldwalls were by no means passive. A Varangian unit that has formed Shieldwall may advance up to its normal move distance and retain the benefit of the Shieldwall. It may also do so when it charges, so long as it does not move further than its normal move distance while doing so.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="fbcb-d677-9eea-1efb" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
